@@ -71,6 +71,14 @@ and `<style>` contents dropped, block elements (`<p>`, `<li>`, ...) separate
 words, entities decoded, whitespace collapsed. The result is plain text and
 is escaped on output.
 
+### `excerpt`
+`{{ post.content | excerpt }}` or `{{ post.content | excerpt:25 }}`: the
+first N words (N >= 1) of the text without HTML, for summaries. Without an
+argument N is `build.excerpt_words`. HTML is removed as by `striptags` and
+words are cut as by `truncatewords`. If the value contains `<!--more-->`,
+the excerpt is the text before the first marker, whatever its length, with
+no ` ...` suffix.
+
 ### `absurl`
 `{{ page.url | absurl }}`: absolute URL using `site.base_url`.
 
